    "description": "FlashGo allows you to change your phone device's GPS location to any location in the world. FlashGo support all devices and phone brands, no Android system version limited. It will work even if app on the backgroud. FlashGo support route mode, you can select vehicle types, walking, speed, cycle mode. App will hide your phone's real GPS location, at the same time, we will protect your location privacy! You can select as many waypoints as you want, and we will optimize the route. Support location history, favorite location. \u2b50 For developer testing purposes.\r\n\r\nSpecial feature: \r\n\u2b50 Change your phone location \r\n\u2b50 Protect privacy and Keep safe\r\n\u2b50 Travel anywhere in the world using your phone\r\n\u2b50 Go navigation routes at real speeds including walking, cycling, and driving.\r\n\u2b50 Jump teleport Mode: Instantly transfer your phone to anywhere in the world with one click.\r\n\u2b50 Supports multiple modes and speeds to change location\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHow to use:\r\n - Select a new location and press the start button.\r\n - The app will insert a change GPS location into the flight GPS on your phone.\r\n\r\n\r\n Download FlashGo: change location to unlock locations around the world!",
